From: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Subject: disable the VideoGrabber capture add-on
Forwarded: not-needed
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Description:
 VideoGrabber is written against the legacy media node consumer API
 (BMediaRoster, BMediaConsumer, BufferGroup); media2 has no equivalent
 roster or consumer contract, so the add-on cannot build here. Screen
 capture is not part of the core editor and the remaining add-ons are
 unaffected.

--- a/source/add-ons/Jamfile
+++ b/source/add-ons/Jamfile
@@ -26,6 +26,6 @@
 SubInclude TOP source add-ons Solarize ;
 SubInclude TOP source add-ons Tile ;
 # SubInclude TOP source add-ons Translate ;
-SubInclude TOP source add-ons VideoGrabber ;
+# SubInclude TOP source add-ons VideoGrabber ;	# legacy media node consumer, no media2 equivalent
 SubInclude TOP source add-ons Wave ;
 SubInclude TOP source add-ons WinGrab ;
